Two things the Windows build of OvmfPkgX64 (scripts/build-edk2.sh
x86_64, Visual Studio 2022 17.14, MSVC 14.44) needs:
- some structure copies compile to memcpy() calls, and EDK2 modules link
  no C library (DisplayEngineDxe: LNK2001 memcpy). The DXE phase's module
  types get CryptoPkg's IntrinsicLib, which provides memcpy and memset;
  not SEC, whose ResetVector is a raw image, not a program to link.
- VS2022 links every X64 module with /ALIGN:4096 and a 0x200 file
  alignment, which GenFv cannot rebase for the PEI phase's
  execute-in-place modules ("Section-Alignment and File-Alignment do not
  match", PeiCore). SEC, PEI_CORE and PEIM link with /ALIGN:32
  /FILEALIGN:32.

diff --git a/OvmfPkg/OvmfPkgX64.dsc b/OvmfPkg/OvmfPkgX64.dsc
index efb0eed..f03fad4 100644
--- a/OvmfPkg/OvmfPkgX64.dsc
+++ b/OvmfPkg/OvmfPkgX64.dsc
@@ -122,6 +122,14 @@
   XCODE:*_*_*_MTOC_FLAGS = -align 0x1000
   CLANGPDB:*_*_*_DLINK_FLAGS = /ALIGN:4096
 
+# 2ksbox: VS2022 links every X64 module with /ALIGN:4096 and the linker
+# keeps a 0x200 file alignment, which GenFv cannot rebase for the PEI
+# phase's execute-in-place modules ("Section-Alignment and File-Alignment
+# do not match", PeiCore). Theirs match again, at the 32 bytes the
+# older Visual Studio toolchains gave them.
+[BuildOptions.common.EDKII.SEC, BuildOptions.common.EDKII.PEI_CORE, BuildOptions.common.EDKII.PEIM]
+  MSFT:*_VS2022_X64_DLINK_FLAGS = /ALIGN:32 /FILEALIGN:32
+
 # Force PE/COFF sections to be aligned at 4KB boundaries to support page level
 # protection of DXE_SMM_DRIVER/SMM_CORE modules
 [BuildOptions.common.EDKII.DXE_SMM_DRIVER, BuildOptions.common.EDKII.SMM_CORE]
@@ -275,6 +283,13 @@
   TdxLib|MdePkg/Library/TdxLib/TdxLib.inf
   TdxMailboxLib|OvmfPkg/Library/TdxMailboxLib/TdxMailboxLib.inf
 
+# 2ksbox: Visual Studio 2022 17.14 compiles some structure copies to
+# memcpy() calls, which EDK2 modules have no C library for
+# (DisplayEngineDxe: LNK2001 memcpy). IntrinsicLib provides them, to
+# the DXE phase's C modules (a SEC module like ResetVector is no program).
+[LibraryClasses.common.DXE_CORE, LibraryClasses.common.DXE_DRIVER, LibraryClasses.common.DXE_RUNTIME_DRIVER, LibraryClasses.common.UEFI_DRIVER, LibraryClasses.common.UEFI_APPLICATION]
+  NULL|CryptoPkg/Library/IntrinsicLib/IntrinsicLib.inf
+
 [LibraryClasses.common.SEC]
   TimerLib|OvmfPkg/Library/AcpiTimerLib/BaseRomAcpiTimerLib.inf
   QemuFwCfgLib|OvmfPkg/Library/QemuFwCfgLib/QemuFwCfgSecLib.inf
